/**
 * Typed, read-only diagnostic tools (v1.25.0, ISC-45.1).
 *
 * This is the ONLY surface the diagnostic chat's model can reach. Every tool:
 *   - is tenant-scoped (the userId is fixed at construction, never a parameter);
 *   - reads through the store/engine seams over a READ-ONLY handle (the MCP
 *     process opens SQLite with SQLITE_OPEN_READONLY; see scripts/diagnose-mcp.ts);
 *   - masks payees and strips raw provider JSON before anything leaves (data
 *     minimisation, owner decision 2026-09-08);
 *   - caps row counts so a question can never ship the whole ledger.
 *
 * There is deliberately no free-form SQL tool (owner decision: typed tools only).
 * The definitions are exported so the MCP server advertises exactly this list
 * and the provider can assert at runtime that nothing else is available.
 */

